                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RL85g",
                  "name": "菜单与按钮规则1",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1. 箭头展开 / 折叠；节点名显示详情，支持菜单含子菜单。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nqDl2",
                  "name": "菜单与按钮规则2",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2. 选中父节点不会授权子菜单或按钮；按钮只能作为叶节点。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HPUec",
                  "name": "菜单与按钮规则3",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3. 菜单支持任意层级；勾选按钮补齐全部有效祖先。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nBIpW",
                  "name": "菜单与按钮规则4",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4. 关闭某节点会清除其全部后代授权，提示数量并可撤销。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wC9jN",
                  "name": "菜单与按钮规则5",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5. 右侧仅配置当前节点直接按钮；子菜单继续进入配置。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
