                  "content": "4. 半选、全选、未选分别有清晰的勾选状态。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
